OL,3,GNEWSAHeath to be 'put straight' after
OL,4,Atree felling
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a Surrey heath have been
OL,7,Ftold the area "is all going to be put
OL,8,Fstraight" after tree felling works.
OL,10,FElmbridge Borough Council says it is
OL,11,Fworking with the Forestry Commission as
OL,12,Fpart of its 20-year management plan for
OL,13,FOxshott Heath
OL,15,FSimon Waugh, deputy leader of the
OL,16,Fcouncil, said ongoing management works
OL,17,Fwere being carried out at a number of
OL,18,Fits heaths.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
