OL,3,GNEWSAHeath to be 'put straight' after
OL,4,Atree felling
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the felling of trees, aiming to
OL,7,Freduce tree cover by about a third,
OL,8,Fmeant light could get to the ground,
OL,9,Fallowing plants to grow back and so
OL,10,Fhelping wildlife.
